<h1>Privacy Policy — TravelDiary</h1>
<p class="date">Last updated: June 2026</p>

<p>TravelDiary does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data to external servers.</p>

<p>All data — including visited places, favorites, notes, and trip plans — is stored exclusively on your device and, if iCloud is enabled, in your personal iCloud account. No one, including the developer, can access your data.</p>

<p>Location data is used exclusively on-device to detect visited places and is never shared with third parties or transmitted over the internet.</p>

<p>TravelDiary does not use analytics, tracking, or advertising SDKs of any kind.</p>

